{
  "title": "Hirz-e-Imam al-Jawad (a.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "This evil-repelling prayer is ascribed to Imam Muhammad ibn Ali al-Jawad (a.s.):\nيَا نُوْرُ يَا بُرْهَانُ يَا مُبِيْنُ يَا مُنِيْرُ\nYAA NOORO YAA BURHAANO YAA MOBEENO YAA MONEERO\nO Light! O Proof! O Manifest One! O Illuminator!\nيَا رَبِّ اكْفِنِى الشُّرُوْرَ وَ اٰفَاتِ الدُّهُوْرِ\nYAA RABBIK FENISH SHOROORA WA AAFAATID DOHOORE\nO my Lord, suffice me against all evils, and the afflictions of time.\nوَ اَسْاَلُكَ‏ النَّجَاةَ يَوْمَ يُنْفَخُ فِىْ الصُّوْرِ.\nWA AS-ALOKAN NAJAATA YAWMA YUNFAKHO FIS SOORE.\nAnd I ask You for salvation on the Day the Trumpet is blown."
}
